@startuml queues
title Telemetry — Kafka: events.raw + retry / DLT

left to right direction
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

rectangle "Producer" as prod {
  component "Ingest API" as ingest
}

queue "Kafka — main" as kafka {
  collections "events.raw\nkey=app_id\n4 партиции, по 2 на шард CH\nтот же directory, что ClickHouse" as t_raw
}

rectangle "Consumer group" as cg {
  component "Storage Writer" as writer
}

database "ClickHouse\nshard по app_id" as ch

queue "Error path (Storage Writer)" as err {
  collections "events.raw.storage-writer.retry\nbackoff / N" as t_retry
  collections "events.raw.storage-writer.dlt\npoison / exhausted" as t_dlt
}

ingest --> t_raw : produce после Redis\n(не outbox: своей БД событий нет)
t_raw --> writer
writer --> ch : batch INSERT раз в 2 с\nидемпотентно по event_id

writer -[#orange]-> t_retry : transient fail INSERT
t_retry --> writer : reprocess
writer -[#red]-> t_dlt : exhausted / poison

note bottom of err
  Per consumer group, не общий retry «на систему»:
  main → fail → .retry (N, backoff)
  → fail → .dlt + алерт.
  Main не блокируется poison-batch;
  соседние партиции другого шарда продолжают flush.
  Replay с DLT безопасен: дедуп event_id
  в Redis (окно) и в ClickHouse.
end note

note right of ingest
  Не через Kafka:
  sdk-config, CRUD владельца,
  промах кэша ключа, дедуп, rate-limit.
end note

@enduml
